      "h2": "Hallo & Guten Tag",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Hallo</strong> is casual hi — for friends. <strong>Guten Tag</strong> is formal — for teachers, shopkeepers, strangers. Use it whenever you'd say 'good day' in English.</p>"
