      "tag": "Time",
      "h2": "Time-Based Greetings",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Guten Morgen</strong> = good morning (until about 11am). <strong>Guten Tag</strong> = afternoon. <strong>Guten Abend</strong> = evening. <strong>Gute Nacht</strong> = good night (going to bed).</p>"
    },
