      "tag": "Bye",
      "h2": "Goodbye",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Auf Wiedersehen</strong> = formal goodbye. <strong>Tschuss</strong> (say 'choose') = casual bye. <strong>Bis bald</strong> = see you soon.</p>"
